<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs - Thursday actual 115,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs - Thursday actual 115,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog marketings Thursday totaled 115,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA said. Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts were $1.00 per cwt lower than midsession Thursday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    53.00 -54.00	   54.00 -55.00</p>
<p>few			52.50  54.50	   53.50  55.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Generally steady to $2.00 lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs  42.00 -43.00	   42.50 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   45.00 -47.00	   46.00 -48.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    48.00 -53.00	   50.00 -53.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
